file C:\My Documents\Business plan.doc
	icon: res://win95/office/icons/word_document_32.png
	contents:
		{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\froman Times New Roman;}}\f0\fs20
		\qc\b\fs36 BUSINESS PLAN\b0\fs20\par
		\qc\i Import and export. Mostly import.\i0\par
		\ql\par
		\b\fs24 1. The idea\b0\fs20\par
		Buy things where they are cheap. Sell them where they are not. Repeat.\par
		\par
		\b\fs24 2. What we import\b0\fs20\par
		To be decided. Ideas so far: computers, cutting edge software, sunglasses.\par
		\par
		\b\fs24 3. Money\b0\fs20\par
		Start-up capital: 0 kr. Needed: some.\par
		Time is money, so every hour saved is profit.\par
		\par
		\b\fs24 4. Next steps\b0\fs20\par
		Get a business computer. Get the software a guy told me about. \ul Think big.\ul0\par
		}
		
